      "is_math": true,
      "char_count": 258,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.00155_p20_b22",
      "text": "variance than the raw log-ratio estimator, and is differentiated through neither the budget\nnor the policy loss.\n",
      "bbox": [
