      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.00155_p20_b24",
      "text": "generate a modest number of responses from the initial policy, and score those responses\nwith both the proxy reward model and a stronger held-out gold reward model. The\nempirical promptwise \u21131 discrepancy between the two provides an initial guess for the\nunscaled budget and hence for e\u03b40 after group normalization. After that, the remaining\n",
