      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.00155_p20_b25",
      "text": "hyperparameters\u2014notably \u03b1, \u03c4, the group size G, and the clipping radius \u03b5clip\u2014are tuned\non a standard held-out validation set evaluated by the stronger reward model.\n",
